cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "ACLDrift: Permission drift detection for RAG indexes"
abstract: >-
  ACLDrift compares every chunk in a vector index with the access list of its
  source document in systems such as Confluence, Google Drive, SharePoint and
  GitHub, and reports chunks that more people can retrieve than could read the
  original.
authors:
